  <h2><a href="/web/20100907085545/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums">Answers</a><span class="delim">/</span><a href="/web/20100907085545/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums/202614-for-parents">For Parents</a></h2>

  <div class="frame">
    <div class="entry nobottom" style="padding-bottom:0;">
      <h3 class="entry-title">How do I create a parent account?</h3>
      <p class="sub">Reese Feb 28</p>
      <div class="user_formatted" style="margin-top:35px;">
        <p>Parent Accounts can be created here: <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20100907085545/http://www.roblox.com/Parents/Register.aspx" target="_new"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20100907085545/http://www.roblox.com/Parents/Register.aspx">http://www.roblox.com/Parents/Register.aspx</a></a> Once the Parent Account is created, log in and follow the links to add your Child Account under the Parent Account. You can then adjust the settings of the Child Account once it has been added.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
